"The following values are adequate if the movies on viewed on a television. "
"Values greater than 0.15 are adequate for letterbox movies. For 16:9 you should "
"use values greater than 0.16 and for 4:3, use greater than 0.17-0.18. "
"Experiment with different values to see what you prefer."
